    {
      "id": "4a5e776f-e05d-4e1e-bb72-260ae1f72de8",
      "name": "Sticky Note9",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1968,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 784,
        "height": 1232,
        "content": "## Shopee Competitive Price Analysis Automation\n\nThis n8n template automates Shopee price monitoring for competitive analysis.\n\nYou can set up alerts by submitting a Shopee product or search URL and your WhatsApp number. On your configured schedule, n8n scrapes the Shopee results, finds the 3 lowest-priced products, and sends a price report directly to WhatsApp using Kapso.\n\n### Use cases\n\nThis template is useful for:\n\n* Monitoring competitor prices on Shopee\n* Finding the lowest prices for similar products\n* Getting scheduled price reports without manually checking Shopee\n* Tracking competitor pricing for competitive analysis\n* Monitoring multiple Shopee URLs with separate alerts\n* Reducing repetitive manual price research\n\n### How it works\n\n* Submit a Shopee URL and WhatsApp number through the alert form.\n* n8n stores the alert in an n8n Data Table and prevents duplicate alerts.\n* The workflow runs automatically based on the configured schedule.\n* n8n retrieves all saved Shopee alerts and processes them one by one.\n* Each Shopee URL is scraped using Apify to collect product data.\n* Products are sorted by price and the 3 lowest-priced products are selected.\n* A price report containing the product name, Shopee URL, and price is sent to WhatsApp using Kapso.\n* The process repeats automatically for all configured alerts.\n\n### How to use\n\n* Set up the n8n Data Table for storing Shopee alerts.\n* Connect your Apify account for Shopee data scraping.\n* Configure your Kapso API credentials.\n* Configure the workflow schedule.\n* Activate the workflow.\n* Submit Shopee URLs and WhatsApp numbers through the provided alert form.\n* The workflow will automatically send competitive price reports based on your schedule.\n\n### Requirements\n\n* n8n\n* n8n Data Tables\n* Apify account\n* Kapso account\n* WhatsApp number\n* A Shopee URL to monitor\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
